# Build output. No trailing slash on these three: a trailing slash matches only a
# directory, and in a git worktree `web/node_modules` is typically a symlink to the
# main checkout's copy -- which then reads as an untracked file, enters `git add -A`
# and every work-tree key computed over it. Measured 2026-11-10: one such symlink
# made the pre-push gate's patch key unforgeable by the committed bytes (7 files
# judged, 8 in the delta), so a green run could not be claimed by the push.
target
node_modules
dist

# Local runtime config (template: cogneva.example.json)
cogneva.json
# Exception: the Helm chart ships its default cogneva.json via .Files.Get
!deploy/helm/cogneva/files/cogneva.json

# Bootstrap runtime artifacts (machine-specific, never commit)
intent_config.yaml
management_plan.yaml

# Self-evolution runtime artifacts written by tests/local runs (sandbox uses a PVC)
evolution-changes/
evolution-patches/

# Coverage counters dropped by instrumented test runs (machine-local)
*.profraw
*.profdata
